## API Endpoints

### Patient Endpoints
- `GET /api/patients` - Search patients with pagination
- `GET /api/patients/{id}` - Get patient details
- `POST /api/patients` - Register new patient
- `PUT /api/patients/{id}` - Update patient information
- `DELETE /api/patients/{id}` - Deactivate patient record

### Encounter Endpoints
- `GET /api/encounters` - List encounters with filtering
- `GET /api/encounters/{id}` - Get encounter details
- `POST /api/encounters` - Create new encounter
- `PUT /api/encounters/{id}` - Update encounter
- `POST /api/encounters/{id}/notes` - Add clinical note to encounter

### Medication Endpoints
- `GET /api/medications` - Search medications
- `GET /api/medications/{id}` - Get medication details
- `POST /api/medications` - Add new medication
- `PUT /api/medications/{id}` - Update medication information

