## Security Measures

### Data Encryption
- AES-256 encryption for all patient data at rest
- TLS 1.3 encryption for all data in transit
- Key management with hardware security modules (HSMs)

### Access Control
- Role-based access control with least privilege principle
- Multi-factor authentication for all users
- Session timeout after 30 minutes of inactivity
- Automatic screen lock for unattended workstations

### Audit Logging
- Comprehensive audit trail of all system activities
- Real-time monitoring of suspicious activities
- Regular audit log reviews
- Automated alerting for security events

### Data Backup and Recovery
- Daily encrypted backups to secure offsite storage
- Weekly disaster recovery drills
- Recovery point objective (RPO): 1 hour
- Recovery time objective (RTO): 4 hours

